cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The Kibbo Streaming Pricing Dataset, 2011–2026"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-20"
abstract: >-
  An original dataset tracking every publicly confirmed price change
  (launch, increase, decrease, or tier restructure) for 10 major US
  streaming platforms, from each platform's launch through September
  2026. 97 rows, 10 platforms, US pricing only. Built for the Kibbo
  Research investigation "The Streaming Price Machine."
authors:
